"P1336930025" "We've got a situation up here, prepare yourselves!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2571963223" "We've got no signs of the obelisk so far. Are we too late?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3151639697" "<t=2> <t=5>Don't know, just watch your back. These Igneous monsters could come out at any moment!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P838107002" "We've got more problems now than the Igneous, it's a villain!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4072171454" "They're somewhere deep within the caves, we have to keep moving!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3053073499" "{HeroName}! We've got a situation!"
