"P3548949342" "Find someone who knows where the obelisk is"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2124629102" "The obelisk is gone, but you've found out where the ritual will take place!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P908969315" "Agh! This is... this is <i>infuriating</i>! These idiots have no idea the work that went into this obelisk! Do they know how many nights I slaved away at creating the magical runes for it?! The <i>years</i> I spent travelling to search for the <i>exact</i> magical rituals to forge it?! No, but they believe just because they figured out how to use it that it is now <i>theirs</i>!<br><br>It is <i>my</i> obelisk, and I will NOT let this stand! But...<br><br>There is <i>something</i> we can do. Oh... oh <i>yes</i>, something indeed..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1932149478" "As we speak, {HeroName}, I can feel the obelisk being powered up. The Lost have worked with their Igneous allies to take over a portion of the <color yellow>Hollows</color>, carving it to match their supposed grand expectations, and to draw the attention of this 'Synapse'.<br><br>Of course, the heroic fool will run straight into a trap. That's the genius behind my creation, you see. Synapse will try to stop them, but the minute he gets near the obelisk, it will leave him weakened and drained, all of his powers <i>pulled</i> out from him and put into the obelisk!<br><br>I will give the Circle credit; I assume they figured out the steps to then have the obelisk transfer its power to someone else. I believe, if what you discovered is true, this 'Lemkin' is the target of this new power. However... I have a plan to turn the tables..."
// AcceptString :
"P3803446114" "And what exactly is this plan?"
// SendOffString :
"P1382161692" "A failsafe, you could say, one that I installed into the obelisk, should a foolish creature try to use it against me.<br><br><color orange>You will have to fight and defeat Lemkin, who will have the power of Synapse within him, though it may not be easy to do so.</color> Once defeated, the powers in the obelisk will shoot out of him and into <i>you</i> if you utter the following phrase...<br><br><color orange>Alastor informs you of the arcane phrase to say at the appropriate time.</color><br><br>This only happens a short period after the power is transferred. It was a foolproof plan of mine; if <i>I</i> ever used the obelisk, I would ensure that <i>no</i> creature was around me. If someone else tried to steal it, then they would not have the time to isolate themselves.<br><br>This was their one fatal mistake, {HeroName}, and we will use it to turn the tables on them! My life's creation will <i>finally</i> be put to use, by US, and then, <i>then</i> I may finally have the peace to see that what I worked for in my life was realized!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P212379119" "Take Synapse's Power for Yourself!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P82364891" "There's only a limited window of time, you hurry to stop the Lost and take Synapse's power!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P4033035978" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: This Beating Sponsored By Synapse </color>"

